  "description": "The Horizon Sport 10 is a fully equipped e-bike designed for smooth, confident daily riding. Bright LED lights enhance visibility in the city, and the Racktime carrier with KID'n'CARRY and SNAPIT 2.0 compatibility makes carrying accessories or a child seat effortless – with trailer capability when more cargo space is needed.\n\nThe adjustable stem makes it easy to find a comfortable riding position, while the SP Connect allows for simple smartphone attachment. Its 100mm suspension fork adds comfort over rough lanes and unpaved shortcuts, while the derailleur drivetrain keeps pedaling efficient and shifting clean. Hydraulic disc brakes provide reliable stopping in all conditions. Schwalbe Energizer Plus tires deliver strong puncture protection and dependable traction for everyday urban travel.\n\nPowered by the Bosch Performance Line CX motor and an 800Wh PowerTube battery, it offers long-lasting support for extended trips or long commutes, and is compatibile with the Bosch PowerMore range extender if desired. The battery removes easily for charging, while the Bosch eBike Flow App allows you to access connectivity features, ride data and upgrade options.",
